# Build artefacts.
#
# The snapshot is rebuilt with `python -m harness --build`; committing it would
# put a moving EDGAR extract in version control, and the dataset's expectations
# are resolved from whichever snapshot is in use, so a committed copy would go
# stale against the code that reads it.
snapshot.sqlite
snapshot.sqlite-*

# Run outputs. A run of the *sealed* dataset against a real model is the
# evidence this experiment exists to produce, so those are committed; the
# verification runs of scripted targets are noise and are not.
#
#   committed:  runs/ollama-local-*/
#   ignored:    runs/scripted-*/, runs/reference-*/, runs/unknown-*/
snapshot.sqlite
snapshot.sqlite-*

runs/scripted-*/
runs/reference-*/
runs/unknown-*/

__pycache__/
